# Travia Core

Vanilla **ES modules** travel budget app (Arabic-first). No backend, no framework, no bundler.

## Stack

- HTML: `index.html`, `plan.html`, `login.html`, `register.html`
- JS: `js/app.js` (search boot), `js/plan-detail-page.js` (plan boot)
- Data: `data/*.js` — destinations, demo search, sample plans, catalog
- i18n: `shared/i18n/ar.js`, `en.js` via `t(key)`
- CSS: `css/style.css`, `shared/theme/variables.css`

## Must follow

- Run via `npm start` (port 3000) — never rely on `file://`
- **No external image URLs** — use color bands + empty image placeholders (`js/plan-images.js`)
- Destination = **free-text input** (`#city-input`) bound to search via `getDestinationFromForm()` / `resolveCityInput()`
- Minimize scope; match existing module style (imports, naming, RTL Arabic UI)
- Bump cache query on HTML assets when changing JS/CSS (`?v=N`)

## Do not

- Add React/Vue/backend unless explicitly requested
- Commit `.env` or real API keys
- Break plan page boot — wrap in try/catch; always render fallback content
